            where specific historical rules are mentioned.
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="stats">
        <div class="container stats-grid">
          <div><b>PYQ</b><span>Reality check</span><p>See what the examination actually asks.</p></div>
          <div><b>TOPIC</b><span>Pattern detector</span><p>Group questions under syllabus topics.</p></div>
          <div><b>ERROR</b><span>Weakness finder</span><p>Identify knowledge and reasoning gaps.</p></div>
