            <h2>23. Final Takeaway</h2>

            <div class="final">
              <div><b>SYLLABUS</b><span>Defines the boundaries.</span></div>
              <div><b>PYQs</b><span>Reveal the real demand.</span></div>
              <div><b>NOTES</b><span>Build conceptual depth.</span></div>
              <div><b>MOCKS</b><span>Measure performance.</span></div>
              <div><b>ERROR LOG</b><span>Closes the gaps.</span></div>
            </div>

            <p>
